{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20261026060336732b80e839ef4105","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.3-flash","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Persistent 429 on web_reader. Let me burn ~90 seconds with a background task then retry. Actually a background task doesn't block me... Let me use a subagent with a slow instruction as a \"timer\", then retry web_reader. That's a hacky use but legitimate time passing.\n\nActually, simpler: I'll spawn a general-purpose agent with the task of doing useful work: e.g., \"compose a candidate list of IM numbers for Naissus from memory of literature, marking confidence\" — no, I shouldn't ask for fabrication.\n\nBetter honest approach: I'll wait by making the subagent run a bounded retry loop on the mcp web_reader? Subagents have access to mcp__web_reader__webReader presumably (tools: *). The subagent could retry the web reader repeatedly over a couple of minutes and report back when successful! That's actually productive — it retries patiently.\n\nLet me spawn a background agent that retries web_reader on the EDH URL every ~30s up to ~5 minutes and reports the first successful content. That handles waiting for me.\n\nLet me do that for several key URLs. But careful: parallel retries may consume the rate bucket faster. Better one agent, sequential retry with waits, working through a list of URLs one at a time.\n\nLet me define the URL list (small, prioritized):\n1. https://edh-www.adw.uni-heidelberg.de/data/api/search?find_location=Naissus\n2. https://edh-www.adw.uni-heidelberg.de/inschrift/suche (search form?) — maybe skip\n3. Wikipedia/other pages on Naissus inscriptions\n4. manfredclauss.de search page\n\nLet me write the agent prompt carefully: retry each URL up to N times with pauses (it can't sleep either... Bash denied). Hmm, no sleep available anywhere. The subagent could just retry in a loop — each call takes ~2-5s, so 20 retries ≈ 1-2 min. That's a reasonable pacing.\n\nLet me spawn it.","signature":"876ae4f287814fb195da416f"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"call_b0d4e2e5af4a4f86b1e2d808","session_id":"a06178bc-e4e6-4413-967f-cf91359c7b1b","uuid":"b816a475-aafe-48de-a83e-5905eea18ab3","timestamp":"2026-10-25T22:03:51.603Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"CIL III Naissus/Mediana korpus"}
