a: robots noindex,nofollow; stylesheet /.within.website/x/xess/xess.min.css)\n\nSo even setting the rate limiter aside, EDH's API is gated behind a JavaScript proof-of-work challenge that this fetcher cannot pass — no inscription records were retrievable from this URL.\n\n**2. https://edh-www.adw.uni-heidelberg.de/data/api/search?find_location=Mediana** — FAILED after 15 retries. All 15 attempts returned 429 ({\"error\":{\"code\":\"1302\",\"message\":\"Rate limit reached for requests\"}}). No content retrieved.\n\n**3. https://manfredclauss.de/gb/search.html** — FAILED after 15 retries. All 15 attempts returned 429 (code 1302). No content retrieved, so whether the Clauss/EDCS site allows a plain GET search remains unverified.\n\nTwo caveats for the caller: (a) the web_reader rate limiter (Z.ai error 1302) never lifted during the entire session, so attempts on URLs 2 and 3 were pure backoff; (b) the one window where a call did get through, the EDH endpoint answered with the Anubis bot wall — meaning EDH may be unreachable by this tool even when the limiter clears. The denied tools (WebFetch, WebSearch, Bash/curl) were not used. Suggested next step: retry later from a fresh session, and consider EDH's other access routes (e.g. the `edh-www.adw.uni-heidelberg.de/inschrift/suche` search or a bulk data dump) rather than hammering the API endpoint.","usage":{"total_tokens":0,"tool_uses":4,"duration_ms":184798},"uuid":"01e4492d-f74c-4e12-bd43-033b9312fec4","session_id":"a06178bc-e4e6-4413-967f-cf91359c7b1b"}
