{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202610260607205c22cba3d8154710","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.3-flash","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The rate limit appears to persist. My one successful-ish call earlier was at the very start (I got real content from manfredclauss.de search page). Since then, everything is 429.\n\nIt seems the quota is extremely tight — maybe 1 request per N minutes. Given the constraint, I could try spacing attempts much further apart. Each subagent run gives ~3 minutes. Let me try one more round: spawn an agent that makes just ONE call and reports, after the ~3 min that have passed. Actually let me just try directly myself now.\n\nLet me try a single webReader call now on the highest-value target. Given EDH has an Anubis wall, the best target is something else. Priorities:\n- IM numbers for Naissus: hard to find online; maybe via a PDF or a database like \"Chiron\" or pleiades/trismegistos. \n- Trismegistos (www.trismegistos.org) has a search by place — Naissus TM Geo ID. Let me try TM: https://www.trismegistos.org/place/... \n- Also \"Last Statues of Antiquity\" (laststatues.info) has Mediana entries with inscriptions.\n- Also the \"Concordantia\" of CIL III.\n- Also \"Plethra\"/\"Epigraphic Database Roma\" (edr).\n- Also \"DAAHL\"? \n- Also \"De Imperatoribus\"? \n\nRealistic best: try Wikipedia sr \"Медијана\" page and \"Naissus\" page, which mention inscriptions (e.g., the votive inscription of the emperor Licinius? Actually there's a famous dedication from Mediana: \"Iovi Invicto...\"?). Hmm.\n\nHonestly the well-known inscriptions from Naissus/Mediana:\n- CIL III 8197ff: Naissus inscriptions in CIL III (Supplementum, p. 232,8197-8217ish). Specifically, CIL III, 8197 = dedication? I'm not certain. Known ones:\n  - CIL III 8198 = dedication to Jupiter? \n  - CIL III 14536?\n  - AE 1979, 534?\n  - IM 30 = Naissus dedication?\n  - IM 32?\n  - IM 33 = inscription about Flavius... \n- Known: IM 30 = inscription of Naissus \"P(ublio) ... \" hmm.\n\nI genuinely do not have reliable memory of IM numbers for Naissus. Fabricating would be wrong. The instructions say: don't invent numbers; be honest.\n\nSo the honest report: web access failed — WebSearch/WebFetch/Bash denied by permission system; the only web tool (mcp web_reader) was rate-limited for the entire session (Z.ai error 1302), with one brief window where EDH responded with an Anubis anti-bot challenge that can't be passed without JS.\n\nBut before giving up, let me make a couple more attempts spaced out. The limiter gave one success at the very beginning (manfredclauss search page). Maybe quota resets hourly. It's been maybe ~10 minutes total. Let me try a couple more single attempts, then write the report.\n\nActually, let me try one more thing: maybe requests succeed rarely. Let me do a single call to manfredclauss.de search GET URL (the earlier success showed a real search form with GET query parameters). The form on manfredclauss.de uses POST to /gb/search.php? Actually EDCS search is at https://manfredclauss.de/gb/search.html with POST to search.php. GET may not work.\n\nLet me try one attempt at manfredclauss.de/gb/search.html to see if the limiter lifted, and simultaneously... no, one at a time.","signature":"9f69c99c30df4bef810f6a68"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"call_b0d4e2e5af4a4f86b1e2d808","session_id":"a06178bc-e4e6-4413-967f-cf91359c7b1b","uuid":"49633e9a-c447-4ac6-9fc7-be7fb4ca7251","timestamp":"2026-10-25T22:07:41.131Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"CIL III Naissus/Mediana korpus"}
