{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20261026061053e9352318f7d04103","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.3-flash","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Confirmed: no web access is usable. I must write the honest report.\n\nStructure of report (in Serbian, latinica):\n\n1. STATUS PRISTUPA (ključno)\n- WebSearch: odbijen permisijom (svaki pokušaj)\n- WebFetch: odbijen permisijom\n- Bash/curl: odbijen permisijom\n- mcp web_reader (jedini dopušten web alat): 429 \"Rate limit reached for requests\" (Z.ai code 1302) — ukupno ~70 pokušaja kroz ~15 min (uključujući subagente), 0 uspešnih od prvih par minuta; jedini prolaz (manfredclauss.de/gb/search.html) vratio je sadržaj koji mi nije bio prikazan; jedan prolaz na EDH API vratio je Anubis anti-bot interstitial (proof-of-work, verzija 1.23.1) — EDH API je, dakle, i kad limiter radi, zatvoren za ne-JS klijente.\n- Zaključak: NIJEDAN podatak iz zadataka (CIL brojevi, IM brojevi, HD brojevi, EDCS pogoci, AE unosi) NIJE danas verifikovan sa weba. Ne mogu da dam listu od 8–20 natpisa bez izmišljanja.\n\n2. ŠTA MOGU DA KAŽEM (neprovereno sa weba, obeleženo poverenjem)\n- Okvir korpusa, bibliografski okvir; naznači nisko poverenje.\n\n3. Plan dobavljanja kad pristup radi — konkretni URL-ovi i parametri.\n\n4. Konflikti: nema — nema podataka.\n\n5. Šta treba od korisnika: dozvola za WebSearch/WebFetch/curl (permission system), ili da se pusti kasnije kad limiter radi.\n\nLet me be careful about what I claim as \"general knowledge\". I'll mark each with confidence and explicitly say not web-verified today.\n\nBibliographic frame I can offer (marked nisko/srednje poverenje, nesadržano sa weba):\n- CIL III = Corpus Inscriptionum Latinarum, vol. III (suppl.), Mommsen; Upper Moesia material largely in the supplements; addenda on p. 232 and index p. 1030 — these are standard CIL III page references. Confidence: srednje (struktura CIL-a je standard, ali konkretne Naissus brojeve nisam proverio).\n- IMS = \"Inscriptions de la Mésie Supérieure\", Beograd (SANU / Centar...), series in Latin/French; volume covering Naissus published by Petar Petrović. I believe IMS IV = Naissus? or IMS VI? Not sure → I will state that the Naissus volume exists in the IMS series and that exact volume number is unverified. Hmm, actually I now recall more strongly: IMS IV is \"Scupi\"? Let me just be honest: \"ne sećam se pouzdano koji je tom\".\n- EDH: records for Naissus exist; HD numbers unverified.\n- EDCS: search only via POST form.\n- AE: unverified.\n\nAlso I can note the well-known general point that Naissus epigraphy includes: votive dedications, military diplomata-related? no; funerary stelae, honorific bases from Mediana, and the notable Christian-era items (e.g. 4th-c. Christian inscriptions?) — better to skip specifics.\n\nOne specific item I'm fairly confident about as general knowledge: at Mediana a villa with a triclinium/aula with the \"Leda\" mosaic; an inscription? no.\n\nAlso: the famous \"Naissus\" inscription mentioning the \"hospitium\"? no.\n\nThere's also the known inscription from Naissus about rebuilding after the Hunnic invasion of 441-443 (mentioned in literature, from the fortification?) — not sure. Skip.\n\nI'll be honest: no inscription-level data verifiable.\n\nAlso mention practical alternative: local repo likely has Medijana database JSON (geofizika_sloj.json etc.) but I was told not to read the pdf folder; the task says web only. I can note that if the caller wants, offline corpora data could be checked in the repo (not the pdf dir), but that's up to them. Keep it brief.\n\nAlso concrete retrieval plan details:\n- EDH API (GET, JSON): \n  - geo: https://edh-www.adw.uni-heidelberg.de/data/api/geo/search?searchstring=Naissus\n  - inscriptions by place: /data/api/search?find_location=Naissus (also find_location_types), and per-record /data/api/inscriptions/HD000123.json? The documented pattern: https://edh-www.adw.uni-heidelberg.de/data/api/inscriptions/HD062478 — not sure of exact per-record route. I'll note the search endpoint and that per-record URLs are /inschrift/HDxxxxxx (HTML).\n  - Anubis wall: need a browser (headless with JS) or EDH bulk downloads at https://edh-www.adw.uni-heidelberg.de/data/export (I think there's an export page). Mention cautiously.\n- EDCS: https://manfredclauss.de/gb/search.html → POST to /gb/search.php; fields include \"s_searchtype\"... I'm not certain of field names; I'll say \"traži POST formu, GET parametri nisu potvrđeni\". The known EDCS search fields (from the form): \"search_inscription\"? Honest: unverified.\n- Alternative with plain GET: Trismegistos (https://www.trismegistos.org/), Pleiades, Last Statues of Antiquity (https://laststatues.info), and the \"Fasti Online\" / \"An Epidoc\" corpora; also \"EDR\" for Italy — irrelevant.\n- Also academic secondary: A. von Premerstein? old; P. Petrović \"Inschriften aus Naissus\"? Uncertain.\n\nAlso I should give the caller the exact error evidence (error ids) briefly.\n\nLet me write the final report in Serbian latinica, structured, no embellishment.\n\nLength: moderate, thorough but not bloated.","signature":"e470a40d6b9a43c1ac4dcfdf"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"call_b0d4e2e5af4a4f86b1e2d808","session_id":"a06178bc-e4e6-4413-967f-cf91359c7b1b","uuid":"615c6621-1030-478f-b92d-63225d5b86d8","timestamp":"2026-10-25T22:11:32.314Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"CIL III Naissus/Mediana korpus"}
