ybe I should check the \"Mediana\" LSA record list via Brave with a different phrasing to find the Hygieia LSA number, and try to fetch the discussion pages.\n\nActually, you know what — let me try ONE more thing that might unlock everything: the LSA site's record pages might have a \"?print=1\" or the full content is in the HTML that webReader's markdown conversion is collapsing. Let me try return_format \"text\" on the https record for 281 — I did, got 2 lines.\n\nHmm, but wait. Let me re-read that: \"Porphyry statue of Asklepios\" / \"Mediana\". That IS a genuine LSA record page — just very short. Which suggests the record.php page for 281 returns a minimal record (maybe the full record requires login, or that record is a stub).\n\nOK, honest report time.\n\nActually, let me try one thing: let me search Brave for the LSA entry pages with \"Mediana\" using a different operator to enumerate all of them.\n\nLet me do this final search."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"call_6ea3e54f733a4c3aa9de858d","session_id":"a06178bc-e4e6-4413-967f-cf91359c7b1b","uuid":"24b37a66-50a1-480f-9930-41b33abaf0a5","timestamp":"2026-10-25T22:21:56.796Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Web research epigrafskih natpisa"}
